---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
---

<section id="start" class="band closing" aria-labelledby="start-title">
  <div class="backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <h2 id="start-title">Pull it. Point it at Postgres. Define something.</h2>
  <pre><code><span class="q">$</span> docker pull <span class="img">ghcr.io/<wbr /><span class="nb">tachyon-cms/</span><wbr />tachyoncms:v0.1.0</span></code></pre>
  <p>Or grab a binary for Linux or macOS. The docs take you from there to your first API key.</p>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn" href="https://docs.tachyoncms.com/install">Get started <Icon name="FiArrowRight" /></a>
    <a class="btn ghost" href="https://github.com/tachyon-cms/tachyoncms">
      <Icon name="FiGithub" /> Star on GitHub
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .closing {
    position: relative;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .closing > :not(.backdrop) {
    position: relative;
  }
  /* The hero's grid and glow, rising from the bottom edge: the page ends where
   * it started. Still. */
  .backdrop {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 calc(50% - 50vw);
    overflow: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
    background:
      radial-gradient(48rem 20rem at 50% 100%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-blue) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%),
      linear-gradient(var(--c-line) 1px, transparent 1px) center bottom / 64px 64px,
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--c-line) 1px, transparent 1px) center bottom / 64px 64px;
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(60% 90% at 50% 100%, #000 20%, transparent 75%);
    mask-image: radial-gradient(60% 90% at 50% 100%, #000 20%, transparent 75%);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  h2 {
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw + 1rem, 3.75rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  pre {
    display: inline-block;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    padding: 11px 14px;
    font: 400 13px/1.5 var(--font-mono);
    text-align: left;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    color: var(--c-muted);
    background: var(--c-panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-line);
    border-radius: 9px;
  }
  code {
    font: inherit;
  }
  .q {
    margin-right: 4px;
    color: var(--c-blue);
  }
  /* On a phone the line breaks after "pull", and below 360 px, where the name alone
   * is too wide, at its slashes. */
  .img,
  .nb {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  @media (max-width: 359.98px) {
    .img {
      white-space: normal;
    }
  }
  p {
    color: var(--c-muted);
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
</style>
